Package: kilix-secrets
Architecture: any
Depends: libkilix-secrets0 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: per-user credential vault for Kilix
 Kilix Secrets is a per-user daemon and an administrative CLI for encrypted
 local credentials. The daemon is socket-activated from the user session.
 Vault files stay under ~/.local/share/kilix-secrets.
 .
 The client library is libkilix-secrets0. Headers are in
 libkilix-secrets-dev.

Package: libkilix-secrets0
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: kilix-secrets (<< 0.1.0+packaging1)
Replaces: kilix-secrets (<< 0.1.0+packaging1)
Description: client library for the Kilix Secrets vault
 Shared library for programs that ask the per-user Kilix Secrets daemon for
 credentials. The daemon keeps the encrypted store; this library is the
 client.

Package: libkilix-secrets-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: libkilix-secrets0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Breaks: kilix-secrets (<< 0.1.0+packaging1)
Replaces: kilix-secrets (<< 0.1.0+packaging1)
Description: development files for the Kilix Secrets client library
 Header, static library and pkg-config file for building against
 libkilix-secrets0.
